  "previewIconUrl": "https://asset-resources.gdevelop.io/public-resources/Icons/Line Hero Pack/Master/SVG/Interface Elements/0842ffc478006e9b6687fca9a5761494c4efd1df873220637af5b4ac7253f850_Interface Elements_interface_ui_window_application_app_button_cta.svg",
  "shortDescription": "A bar across the top of the screen with the lives, the score, the coins and a pause button.",
  "version": "1.0.1",
  "description": [
    "A HUD bar for the top of the screen, on mobile and desktop: the lives on the left, the score in the middle, the coins and a pause button on the right.",
    "",
    "Put it on a UI layer, at the top of the screen, as wide as the screen. Its parts stay at their side when it is resized, and each part can be hidden.",
    "Change the lives, the score and the coins with actions, and use the \"Pause button is clicked\" condition to open a pause menu.",
    "",
    "It is made of the objects of the \"Resource bar (separated units)\", \"Animated score counter\" and \"Button\" extensions.",
    "",
    "Ready-to-use HUD bars in many styles are in the asset store [HUD bars pack](https://editor.gdevelop.io/?initial-dialog=asset-store&asset-pack=hud-bars-hud-bars)."
  ],
